  "privacy": "Privacy",
  "privacyNoticeTitle": "A word on privacy",
  "privacyNotice": "Whowolf has no accounts, no ads and no tracking. At the table, game data travels end-to-end encrypted between your devices only. So that players without a shared Wi-Fi can join, the host's device connects to the server play.whowolf.de; it only forwards encrypted data and, like any server, sees the IP addresses. You can switch it off in the settings.",
  "privacyRead": "Read the privacy notice",
  "privacyOk": "Got it",
  "relayOff": "No online server (Wi-Fi only)",
  "relayOffHint": "Then only devices in the same Wi-Fi can play, and nothing goes to a server.",
  "relayCustomHint": "With your own server, its operator is responsible for it and sees the IP addresses of the connected devices.",
  "privacyTitle": "Privacy in the app",
  "privacyUpdated": "Last updated: 27 October 2026",
  "privacySummaryTitle": "In short",
  "privacySummary": "No accounts, no ads, no tracking, no analytics. The app keeps nothing about you on a server.",
  "privacyTableTitle": "At the table",
  "privacyTable": "Game data travels only between the devices at the table, end-to-end encrypted. So that others find the room, the host's device announces it in the local network (room code, the host's name, a mark of its key); only devices in the same Wi-Fi see it.",
  "privacyServerTitle": "The online server",
  "privacyServer": "So that players without a shared Wi-Fi can join, the host's device connects to play.whowolf.de, run by the project owner (see the imprint on whowolf.de). The server is located in Germany, hosted by ZAP-Hosting GmbH (Münster). The server only forwards end-to-end encrypted data and can read neither names nor roles nor moves. It necessarily processes the IP addresses of the connected devices, in memory only and only while connected, to forward messages and to limit abuse; they are neither stored nor logged. The legal basis is our legitimate interest in providing the game you asked for and protecting the server (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). In the settings you can switch the server off or enter your own; its operator is then responsible.",
  "privacyDeviceTitle": "On your device",
  "privacyDevice": "Your name and a session key for rejoining are kept in your device's protected storage (12 hours at most). The host's device keeps the game state until the room closes. None of it leaves your device except encrypted, for the game.",
  "privacyRightsTitle": "Your rights",
  "privacyRights": "You have the right to access, rectification, erasure and restriction of processing, to data portability and to object (Art. 15 to 21 GDPR), and you may complain to a data protection authority (Art. 77 GDPR). As the server stores nothing, there is no stored data about you. The full version is on whowolf.de.",
